%% Render: ~/.zcode/tools/mermaid-render/render.sh -i vision-step-detail.mmd -o ../images/vision-step-detail.png -b white -s 2 -w 1600
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Loop code
    participant W as Writer model (Haiku)
    participant J as Judgment model (Jev)
    participant C as Chrome
    participant Y as You

    L->>C: read the page - accessibility tree + window screenshot
    C-->>L: page state
    Note over L: code checks the done condition first
    L->>W: author the verification battery for the active subtask
    W->>J: batched checks over text + image
    J-->>W: answer per check
    W->>W: one image confirmation pass
    W-->>L: battery verdicts
    Note over L,W: a confident red flag stops the step before anything is touched
    L->>W: propose up to 3 controls
    W-->>L: verb + description per control
    L->>J: ground each control - one box, then pick one
    J-->>L: box + pick
    L->>L: the risk gate classifies the action
    alt consequential action
        L->>Y: gate card - class, site, consequence
        Y-->>L: approve within 30 seconds (a timeout denies)
    end
    L->>C: tap, type, or scroll as gestures
    C-->>L: the screen changes
    Note over L: the next iteration verifies the outcome - code owns finality
